From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] canaan-hwtimer: add the k230 hardware timer driver

Add a driver for the K230 hardware timer block, compatible
canaan,k230-hwtimer. Each timer channel described in the device tree is
a misc device /dev/timerN; reading it returns the counter frequency
measured over the window set with the TMIOC_SET_TIMEOUT ioctl.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/canaan-hwtimer/Kconfig          |  13 +
 drivers/canaan-hwtimer/Makefile         |   7 +
 drivers/canaan-hwtimer/canaan-hwtimer.c | 321 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 341 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/canaan-hwtimer/Kconfig
 create mode 100644 drivers/canaan-hwtimer/Makefile
 create mode 100644 drivers/canaan-hwtimer/canaan-hwtimer.c

